SUMMARY:Deadline 17:00 GMT: BFI Flare 2027: London LGBTQIA+ Film Festival S
 ubmissions (40th edition)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 04 Dec 2026 at 17:00 GMT.\n\nBFI Flare\, the UK's longes
 t-running LGBTQIA+ film festival\, is open for submissions to its 40th edi
 tion at BFI Southbank in March 2027. CATEGORIES (new length bands this yea
 r): short films of 35 minutes or less\, mid-length films of 36 to 60 minut
 es and feature-length films over 61 minutes\, each open to UK and internat
 ional work.\n\nOrganisation: BFI (British Film Institute)\nLocation: BFI S
 outhbank\, London\, UK (March 2027\, dates to be confirmed). Open to UK an
 d international films.\nAward: NO PUBLISHED CASH\, listed under the desk's
  festival exception. Past editions charged no entry fee\; the 2027 fee is 
 stated in the submission guidelines PDF and could not be confirmed.\nDurat
 ion: Festival in March 2027 (dates to be confirmed)\n\nMore: https://www.b
 fi.org.uk/explore-our-festivals/submissions-are-now-open-2027-edition-bfi-
 flare-london-lgbtqia-film-festival?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&u
 tm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.bfi.org.uk/explore-our-festivals/submissions-are-now-open-2
 027-edition-bfi-flare-london-lgbtqia-film-festival?utm_source=artificialno
 uveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:BFI Southbank\, London\, UK (March 2027\, dates to be confirmed). 
 Open to UK and international films.
END:VEVENT
